<article class="demo" data-cid="AP-BGND-019" data-name="分区带底" data-cat="BGND">
  <div class="demo__head"><span class="demo__name">分区带底</span></div>
  <p class="demo__note">适合：同一页内按主题交替的整行底色</p>
